pico-8 cartridge // http://www.pico-8.com
version 42
__lua__
you go around and find 
ingredients for your potion.
your potion can make stuff for
you that helps you find
ingredients.
you can find money and go to
the store.
there are ingredients at the
store.
sometimes your potions make
evil spirits that are evil
and try to kill you.
you need to get 11 ingredients
and when you get all of your
ingredients you press x and
it makes something that will
help y0u with the game or
it will make evil spirits. 
